{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">伯恩斯坦：禾赛SGI指引上调至2-3亿元，三季度收入增速预计38%</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">禾赛<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>财报里最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的，不是收入本身，而是公司对战略增长业务（SGI）全年指引的上调。从原来的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1亿元</span>人民币，直接提高到2到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3亿元</span>。这个动作意味着，机器人执行器这条新业务线，商业化速度比管理层自己预期的还要快。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看整体数字。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>禾赛收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.61亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21.9%</span>，基本符合市场预期。但经营利润只有<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">200万</span>元，同比下滑超过九成，大幅低于市场预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.14亿元</span>。原因不复杂：管理费用和研发投入都超出了预期。公司正在为机器人业务和下一代激光雷达技术加大投入，短期利润被压下来了。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">真正让这份报告有看头的是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>指引。公司预计收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">38%</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45%</span>，相比前几个季度的节奏变化明显重新<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>。这个<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>信号，和SGI业务开始贡献收入是同步的。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUXbyiaxw5m9XUIWUxX0A0nZTJjqGSTNI0KBTuCJ4icvPCBjAqj16ibHibsqjDX8eDUESDwwhDPCJcO9CGnP3piblWfMcgwy9IBcxK0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 机器人执行器已交付超一万台，单价超过三千元</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">SGI业务在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>开始产生收入，主要来自向Sharpa交付机器人执行器。截至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>末，交付量超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1万</span>台，单价超过3000元人民币。Sharpa的灵巧手产品售价约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5万</span>美元，定位高端，市场反馈不错。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>认为，禾赛的执行器在未来一年内能保持稳定增长和可持续定价。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">另一个产品Kosmo预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>开始贡献收入。管理层给的目标是，到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>年SGI业务收入达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1亿美元</span>，同时实现盈亏平衡。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看执行器单价这个数字，超过3000元人民币，远高于激光雷达单件价值。简单说，SGI业务对收入的拉动逻辑和激光雷达完全不同，它靠的是机器人硬件的高附加值。我更关注的是Kosmo三季度能否如期放量，这决定了SGI指引上调是脉冲式还是趋势性。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWvIiczicTSY0RiaEsThZnJtfiaycgVHJbaMPUbhmPpG8UKBClWjrTNwvJh3X5jlOyxeLrcIql4tMVxc4lUHd7JHH8g1CWicx9oosB0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 车载激光雷达份额<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47%</span>，多激光雷达配置开始下沉</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>禾赛ADAS激光雷达出货量同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">60%</span>，机器人激光雷达出货量同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">193%</span>。但收入增速只有<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，原因是混合平均售价在下降。量增价减，这是激光雷达行业的老问题。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">根据盖世汽车的数据，禾赛在中国长距离ADAS激光雷达市场<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>份额为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47%</span>，领先于速腾聚创的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23%</span>、华为的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21%</span>和Seyond的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>。更值得留意的是，理想汽车把多激光雷达配置从L9、L8下探到了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25万</span>元级别的L6车型。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>多激光雷达方案可能从旗舰车型走向主流市场。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUVobqU5hXt7DnwNTic62WS6CuKQlY96kyqyJIEATzm6D7o9ChAK1lBWWPDwNFcTJQStoC8AYb0PL4ibicBO6WQibVQv0lRc3xhaLU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 经营利润<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">承压</span>，研发和管理费用是主要变量</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>经营利润率只有<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.3%</span>，去年同期是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.2%</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>的模型显示，全年研发费用预计从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.97亿元</span>增加到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>的9.77亿元。管理费用也在上升。公司在同时押注激光雷达和机器人两条线，费用端的不确定性短期内不会消失。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">不过，净利润反而同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">60%</span>，达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7100万</span>元。这主要靠利息收入和其他非经营项目支撑。经营层面还在盈亏平衡线附近徘徊。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 把经营利润和净利润分开看，能看出这家公司目前的状态。经营端在投入期，利润被费用吃掉；净利润靠财务收入撑住。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWp3dltKq3icduh5SibSRNyd0lR7BAD46JvgjYcmgSlFNlSTnJpibYs85XDfiapQlZybZydriciaafenslrQMKgLnzOj38zMjAsNgpibw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 06-Bernstein-Hesai Group-2525.HK-Hesai- The focus shifts to Strategic Growth Initiatives -SGI--260819</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
